3,0,,status,Misaki,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""VILLAGER"",""alive"":true}"
4,0,,status,Mizuki,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""WEREWOLF"",""alive"":true}"
5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,Let us begin calmly. I believe the most efficient path is for the Seer to share their findings as soon as they are certain.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with the need for efficiency, but we must be careful. A fake Seer could easily mislead us early on.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Rin,,"I'm a bit nervous! Should we just trust whoever says they are the Seer, or is that too dangerous?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Misaki,,Trusting blindly is risky. I will be watching for any contradictions in how people react to the information.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,A balanced approach is best. Let us observe the flow of conversation today and see who among us is perhaps too eager to lead.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"Observation is valuable, but every day we wait is a day the werewolf can strike. We need a strategy for verification.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, if you are the Seer, would you be willing to reveal a result immediately on Day 1 to save us time?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Rin,,That sounds like a great idea! It would make things so much simpler if we knew for sure.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Mizuki, you seem very keen on speeding up the process. Why the rush?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Now, now, Misaki. Mizuki is likely just thinking of the collective safety. Efficiency isn't always a sign of guilt.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I will do what is necessary for the village. If my information can pinpoint the wolf, I shall share it.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I simply believe in logical progression. The sooner we narrow the suspects, the safer we are.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Rin,,I'll follow whatever the smartest people decide! I just hope I don't get eaten.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Misaki,,I'm still observing. The way some of you are defending others is more interesting than the strategy itself.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,It is a pleasure to see such diverse perspectives. Let us maintain this harmony while we seek the truth.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
