30,1,,status,Mizuki,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""WEREWOLF"",""alive"":true}"
31,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I have the result. Mizuki is the werewolf. We should act now to ensure our victory.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,What? That is a blatant lie! I am a villager. Jonathan is likely the werewolf trying to frame me immediately.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Oh no! One of you is lying! @Jonathan, are you really the Seer?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"A direct claim on the first day is bold. @Mizuki, your reaction was very fast.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"This is quite a dramatic start. While Jonathan's certainty is impressive, we must consider if this is a calculated move to divide us.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I have no reason to lie. The divination was clear. Mizuki is the enemy.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Benjamin, thank you for being rational. Jonathan is trying to force a vote before we can even think. It's a classic wolf tactic.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I don't know who to believe! Benjamin says we should be careful, and he's always so smart.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Jonathan, if you are the Seer, you've already found the wolf. Why not explain your reasoning for picking Mizuki last night?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Exactly. A bit of context would make your claim more palatable, Jonathan.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,My reasoning is irrelevant; the Seer's power is absolute. The result is the fact.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,Absolute power is exactly what a werewolf pretends to have to control the vote. I am innocent.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Rin,,"But if Jonathan is telling the truth, we win right now! That's so exciting!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"The tension between Jonathan and Mizuki is clear, but Benjamin's subtle redirection is what concerns me.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mizuki"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I only wish to avoid a mistake. Executing an innocent villager would be a tragedy and a victory for the wolf.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,We cannot let fear of a mistake paralyze us. The evidence is there.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,The only evidence is the word of a man who wants me gone. Do not fall for it.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Rin,,I think I'll trust Jonathan. He seems very sure of himself!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I've heard enough. The logic of the Seer's claim is stronger than the denial of the accused.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"If the majority is leaning that way, I shall not stand in the way of the village's will.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
